WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:20.493
"You had green Waldo echoed, and Ben gulped.

2
00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:25.135
If Miss Bungle hadn't turned purple, then her sickness was different.

3
00:00:26.095 --> 00:00:29.936
That meant Waldo's talk potion could have caused the epidemic after all.

4
00:00:31.048 --> 00:00:33.989
Mr. Freaky hurried into the lobby with the health inspector.

5
00:00:34.749 --> 00:00:36.890
The principal beamed when he saw Miss Bungle.

6
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.250
"I thought you were still ill!"

7
00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:42.831
"I'm feeling better now," said Miss Bungle.

8
00:00:42.851 --> 00:00:46.572
"I just stopped by to check on a few things.

9
00:00:47.193 --> 00:00:49.193
What is this purple epidemic?"

10
00:00:50.413 --> 00:00:51.854
Mr. Freaky shook his head.

11
00:00:51.874 --> 00:00:53.634
"We don't know.

12
00:00:54.475 --> 00:00:55.815
I assumed you had it too."

13
00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:57.755
She shook her head.

14
00:00:57.775 --> 00:01:01.485
"No." "Miss Bungle!"

15
00:01:01.805 --> 00:01:03.267
the office ogre commanded.

16
00:01:03.287 --> 00:01:05.709
"You must leave at once!"

17
00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.651
The health inspector narrowed his eyes.

18
00:01:08.671 --> 00:01:11.914
"This is the teacher who's been out sick?"

19
00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:14.256
"Yes." Mr.

20
00:01:14.316 --> 00:01:15.397
Freaky introduced her.

21
00:01:15.417 --> 00:01:21.662
"You're not purple," the inspector said to Miss Bungle in a suspicious tone.

22
00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:26.746
While the man scribbled on his clipboard, Ben turned toward Waldo.

23
00:01:26.766 --> 00:01:28.127
"Come on!"

24
00:01:28.527 --> 00:01:29.128
he whispered.

25
00:01:31.628 --> 00:01:33.529
They found a quiet spot in the hallway.

26
00:01:33.549 --> 00:01:39.050
"Now we know my talk potion caused the epidemic," Waldo moaned.

27
00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:42.671
"We have to find out who tried to ruin my experiment!

28
00:01:44.412 --> 00:01:47.612
And we need a cure for this disease before it spreads to People Place."

29
00:01:50.713 --> 00:01:52.634
Waldo glanced at the health inspector.

30
00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:55.795
"The people are obviously worried about it.

31
00:01:57.615 --> 00:02:00.216
Oh!" Waldo's glasses flew off his face.

32
00:02:00.904 --> 00:02:02.085
"I just thought of something!"

33
00:02:02.565 --> 00:02:03.445
Ben was startled.

34
00:02:03.465 --> 00:02:08.247
"What?" Waldo picked up his glasses and put them back on.

35
00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:11.268
"There were two humans at the dance, remember?

36
00:02:12.749 --> 00:02:14.009
And neither turned purple.

37
00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:19.271
So maybe Just then the health inspector's phone rang.

38
00:02:19.291 --> 00:02:23.333
"Hello? Oh no!

39
00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:25.474
That's terrible news.

40
00:02:26.374 --> 00:02:27.035
Yes, sir.

41
00:02:27.395 --> 00:02:28.795
I'll get out of here right away.

42
00:02:28.855 --> 00:02:30.256
I'll meet you at the hospital."

43
00:02:31.264 --> 00:02:34.986
The health inspector put the phone back in his pocket and rushed for the doorway.

44
00:02:35.006 --> 00:02:39.647
"I can't stay here any longer," he called over his shoulder.

45
00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:42.629
"Two people have turned purple!"

46
00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.130
Ben sighed.

47
00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:49.932
"Now Mrs.

48
00:02:49.972 --> 00:02:53.193
Hubbletree and Dave, Jen's date, are purple too.

49
00:02:54.353 --> 00:02:58.535
Sorry, Waldo, but your talk potion definitely caused this epidemic."

50
00:02:59.715 --> 00:03:00.736
Waldo slumped.

51
00:03:01.544 --> 00:03:02.444
"You're right, Ben."

52
00:03:04.225 --> 00:03:06.626
Mr. Icky's voice came over the loudspeaker.

53
00:03:06.646 --> 00:03:08.247
"Time for dinner!

54
00:03:09.247 --> 00:03:11.528
Everyone, please report to the cafeteria.

55
00:03:12.469 --> 00:03:17.050
We have frog brain stew, fried caterpillars, and pond scum soup."

56
00:03:19.451 --> 00:03:21.812
Ben and Waldo walked down the crowded hallway.

57
00:03:21.832 --> 00:03:23.953
"This is fun!"

58
00:03:24.253 --> 00:03:24.874
said a ghoul.

59
00:03:24.894 --> 00:03:27.114
"I love lockdowns!"

60
00:03:27.134 --> 00:03:29.275
"Me too!"

61
00:03:29.856 --> 00:03:30.496
said a troll.

62
00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.401
"I can't wait to eat!"

63
00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:39.464
Ben and Waldo arrived in the cafeteria and waited in line for their food.

64
00:03:44.127 --> 00:03:45.948
smells good in here," said Ben.

65
00:03:46.908 --> 00:03:47.809
Waldo sniffed.

66
00:03:47.829 --> 00:03:50.470
"Yeah, it does."

67
00:03:51.351 --> 00:03:52.151
He looked around.

68
00:03:53.152 --> 00:03:54.973
A lot of monsters were already eating.

69
00:03:54.993 --> 00:03:58.054
"You know what, Ben?

70
00:03:59.295 --> 00:04:00.816
It feels good in here too."

71
00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:02.308
"What do you mean?"

72
00:04:02.908 --> 00:04:03.509
asked Ben.

73
00:04:03.529 --> 00:04:06.269
"Look around," said Waldo.

74
00:04:06.289 --> 00:04:07.790
"Do you notice anything?"

75
00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:09.930
Ben gazed at the tables.

76
00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:11.871
"Watch this!"

77
00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:13.071
called a werewolf.

78
00:04:14.191 --> 00:04:18.352
He held one of his nostrils shut and shot a fried caterpillar out of the other one.

79
00:04:19.093 --> 00:04:20.833
His friends laughed hysterically.

80
00:04:24.614 --> 00:04:25.934
Ben looked back at Waldo.

81
00:04:25.954 --> 00:04:28.295
"I don't notice anything unusual."

82
00:04:28.315 --> 00:04:31.296
"Exactly!" said Waldo.

83
00:04:31.996 --> 00:04:33.697
"Everyone is acting as they normally do.

84
00:04:34.477 --> 00:04:36.677
I don't think this is an epidemic at all.

85
00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:38.398
We're not sick.

86
00:04:39.098 --> 00:04:40.379
We're just purple."

87
00:04:41.599 --> 00:04:42.319
Ben nodded.

88
00:04:42.339 --> 00:04:44.360
"I do feel fine."

89
00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.340
He thought for a moment.

90
00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:50.181
"Okay, so we don't have to worry about a cure.

91
00:04:50.982 --> 00:04:53.462
We just need to figure out who ruined your experiment."

92
00:04:53.482 --> 00:04:58.604
"The school was pretty empty when we went to the lab," Waldo thought aloud.

93
00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:03.323
"The witches on the dance committee were in the restroom upstairs getting ready.

94
00:05:04.163 --> 00:05:06.285
The only monster we saw in the hallway was Jen."

95
00:05:07.225 --> 00:05:08.186
Waldo gasped.

96
00:05:08.806 --> 00:05:13.089
"It could have been her, or Maybe it was her date, Dave!"

97
00:05:13.109 --> 00:05:16.952
"Maybe," said Ben.

98
00:05:16.972 --> 00:05:19.634
"He did get lost in the building."

99
00:05:21.035 --> 00:05:22.296
Ben remembered how Mr.

100
00:05:22.356 --> 00:05:23.857
Creepy had suddenly appeared.

101
00:05:23.877 --> 00:05:26.458
"What about the science teacher?"

102
00:05:27.399 --> 00:05:28.500
Waldo shook his head.

103
00:05:29.584 --> 00:05:30.385
"No way Mr.

104
00:05:30.425 --> 00:05:31.445
Creepy would be involved."

105
00:05:32.426 --> 00:05:33.907
He looked around the cafeteria.

106
00:05:33.927 --> 00:05:37.189
"It's too bad Monster Academy is in lockdown.

107
00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.892
I wish we could sneak out to People Place and question Dave."

108
00:05:43.954 --> 00:05:44.875
Ben smiled.

109
00:05:44.895 --> 00:05:48.978
"Actually, I might be able to go and question him.

110
00:05:50.278 --> 00:05:51.179
Watch this."

111
00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:55.362
Concentrating, Ben moved his hand toward the wall.

112
00:05:56.503 --> 00:06:01.907
Just as his hand reached the wall, light sparkled, and Ben's hand passed right through the wall!

113
00:06:03.068 --> 00:06:04.609
Waldo's eyes went wide.

114
00:06:04.629 --> 00:06:10.133
"Wow!" "I finally figured out how to do it," said Ben proudly.

115
00:06:10.153 --> 00:06:15.717
"I'll sneak out, go to the hospital in People Place, and see what I can find out."

116
00:06:16.738 --> 00:06:17.539
"What about the flu?"

117
00:06:17.899 --> 00:06:18.579
said Waldo.

118
00:06:18.599 --> 00:06:20.020
"You could spread it."

119
00:06:21.141 --> 00:06:21.922
Ben shrugged.

120
00:06:21.942 --> 00:06:24.464
"I think it's a risk I have to take."

121
00:06:26.944 --> 00:06:28.646
He floated toward the school's lobby.

122
00:06:29.788 --> 00:06:33.753
First he tried opening the doors, but the office ogre had locked them tightly.

123
00:06:34.774 --> 00:06:35.916
Ben glanced around.

124
00:06:37.017 --> 00:06:42.264
And then, sure that nobody was watching, he turned back to the doors and floated right through them.
